			statline = "CD 90 s | E 40 | H 30 | W 1.3 s | R 18 m | P 100",
			desc = "Create an 8-metre circle divided into Yin and Yang halves for 7 seconds. Yin grants allies 20 healing per second; Yang deals enemies 25 damage per second. Rotate the dividing line up to 90 degrees once with a 0.8-second preview.",
